      "writtenOn": "2014-08-19T20:17:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should pull this for loop out into a new function, i.e. motion_sensors_init(). Then we can restructure this function like\n\nmotion_sense_task(void)\n{\n  static int sensors_initialized \u003d 0;\n\n  /* init LPC interface */\n\n  while (1) {\n    if (!motion_sense_active)\n      task_wait_event(-1);\n\n    if (motion_sense_active \u0026\u0026 !sensors_initialized)\n      motion_sensors_init();\n\n    /* read sensors, process them, post to LPC */\n  }\n}",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 216,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 216,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "ba15a9fde175724d269089e355b8b1c6b0c793f9",
